// The FMX styles GDEM's themes use, linked into the programs as RCDATA
// resources so they are inside them on every platform, with nothing to
// deploy. ApplyTheme in GDEMThemes looks for these names first.
//
// The .style files are the ones RAD Studio ships in $(BDS)\Redist\styles\Fmx.
// buildstyles.cmd, run by each project's pre-build event, copies any that are
// missing into this folder and compiles this file, from this folder, into
// GDEMThemes.res, which the programs link in. The IDE does not compile this
// file itself, as it may do so before the pre-build event has run.

GDEMDarkStyle            RCDATA "Dark.style"
GDEMAquaGraphiteStyle    RCDATA "AquaGraphite.style"
GDEMRubyGraphiteStyle    RCDATA "RubyGraphite.style"
GDEMGoldenGraphiteStyle  RCDATA "GoldenGraphite.style"
